278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With the rise of new smart technologies like artificial intelligence, the importance of possessing knowledge in technology and engineering becomes more vital than ever. Yet across the nation and especially in Oregon, there is still a disparity in access and participation in these courses, specifically computer science \(CS\). )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
