289 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (B. Project Scope and Expected Benefits)
/E (B. Project Scope and Expected Benefits)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
290 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (When volunteering at local schools, we discovered a lack of access and participation in STEM classes among students. After talking to them, we found out why. Those without access were unaware they could take these courses and struggled to find alternative learning opportunities. Meanwhile, students with access found STEM classes intimidating due to false assumptions and lack of demographic representation. Existing solutions like company visits lack the excitement and reliability that students need, and no solutions currently address access and participation issues simultaneously. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
291 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Hence, as students ourselves, we believe we can offer what others cannot: the passion and experiences of a fellow student.   Because we wholeheartedly believe in the significance of STEM education and can personally attest to how crucial it has been in our own experiences, we can successfully convey this message on a more personal level to students, and become the representation they seek. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
