<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our project has 3 main goals, and we use them as benchmarks to ensure we stay on track to impact a diverse group of students and inspire them to engage in STEM.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
