<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We also collaborated with organizations like STEM Like a Girl which provides opportunities for girls, and Engaging Every Student which provides opportunities for students from low-income communities. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
