/T (SHARE THE IMPORTANCE OF STEM AND CS EDUCATION)
/E (SHARE THE IMPORTANCE OF STEM AND CS EDUCATION)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We aim to not only teach students and demonstrate how exciting STEM can be but also educate them about its importance in fostering important skills that can be used in both schools and finding future jobs. Sparkers shared personal stories on how STEM has positively impacted their lives, and informational videos were shown.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To ensure that students continue to learn beyond our direct involvement, we provided resources for students to explore so they could continue their STEM adventure. For example, we provided links to free software to learn programming, and tutorials to DIY projects to develop creativity and engineering skills. Lastly, we connected them with organizations that share local workshops and company tours for them to attend.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
