476 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (After the pilot plan was released, we contacted and acquired many potential investors by pitching them our initiative and the predicted impact. We were able to gain the majority of our capital from the investors, while other material and labor costs were covered by forged collaborations with local organizations. These partnerships provided us with a variety of activities we could provide during our program, such as circuit kits, LED vests, and more. Additionally, all of the Sparkers are volunteers, from robotics teams, and local organizations like STEM Like a Girl and ChickTech. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
