520 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (After the Portland Metro STEM Hub sent out the informational video on our behalf to the entire Portland Metro School District, we immediately garnered interest and began organizing visits to schools. There were 2 methods of signing up for a session: emailing us or registering through our website \(see appendix\). Just only 3 days after the email was sent out, we already had 8 schools interested in having us visit. Currently, we offer two types of sessions:)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (a. School Lessons - We visited classrooms, after-school clubs, STEM nights, and more. Usually, the teacher \(who taught STEM or STEAM\) would allocate a portion of their class period for our interactive session, and we would stay for multiple classes.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
