554 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Since all the Sparkers were volunteers, the budget was significantly reduced as transportation and meals were all self-covered. The main cost came from the materials needed to host the various activities we offered. To reduce costs, we bought materials in bulk beforehand, anticipating the demand we would receive. Hence, many of the activity materials can be reused for 2-3 sessions. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
555 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Overall, the total expense came out to $404.63, which is under 40% of our funds. We are considering implementing new activities and removing the more expensive and less popular options to be more cost-effective. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
