560 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We utilize a shared Google calendar system, displaying no-school days, meetings with potential collaborators, and scheduled sessions. By labeling the event with relevant information, we are all informed of whether a session is rescheduled, the location of the event, the overall schedule of that day \(which classes visited\), and more. Sparkers can access the calendar to remind themselves of upcoming events, and to aid in scheduling sessions with schools.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
