/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The project lead manages the budget which is then shared with advisors for suggestions. Basic materials needed for the sessions are bought separately by teams to reduce complications and are then sent in for reimbursement to the project lead. Previously acquired sponsorships cover the fees; currently, more than 80% of the initial funding is left. Future capital will be acquired through business pitches to local organizations and industry companies, and through outreaches. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
