<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 924 0 R
/ActualText (Quality of Sparkers: To ensure the quality of the Sparkers, the project lead works closely with them, getting them informed of the Sparks of STEM initiative, and working through preliminary training, safety training, and the overall process from organizing a session to executing it. Therefore she can ensure the projected quality of the project. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
