580 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (During the summer, we visited the Code, Dance, Create camp, teaching 40+ kids how to code through our session!)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
581 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Another issue encountered was the overwhelming demand, especially during the initial release. Due to the restriction of time availability from Sparkers who were still in school, only 2-3 during-school SOS sessions were able to be hosted, decreasing the efficiency. To solve this issue, we recruited more teams within the same area. For example, the robotics team All Hands on Tech was invited to participate and host their own sessions.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
582 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Lastly, during the middle of January, there was a snow blizzard in the Portland area, and schools were shut down. Coincidentally, an SOS was scheduled for that week. Thanks to quick and effective communication with the school, the session was moved to the next week.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
