601 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Connecting with 3 STEM Hubs, 6 school districts, and impacting a diverse community of students \(girls, SPED, ELD, rural areas, low-income areas, minority races\), we are proud to say that we left a smile on 100% of the students. Not only did we share about the importance of STEM, but we emphasized how fun it could be, and provided them with resources to continue learning even when we leave their school. Through our efforts, we hope to inspire the next generation of STEM!)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
602 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T <8D5468697320697320746865206D6F73742066756E20776590766520657665722068616420696E2074686520636C617373726F6F6D218E20>
/E <8D5468697320697320746865206D6F73742066756E20776590766520657665722068616420696E2074686520636C617373726F6F6D218E20>
