604 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (B. Lessons Learned)
/E (B. Lessons Learned)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
605 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (From this project, we learned the importance of effective planning and flexibility. We found success in using a shared calendar that allowed us to coordinate schedules and availability among volunteers and collaborators and reschedule sessions, which came in use when several sessions had to be adjusted to accommodate a sudden winter storm. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
606 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We had to make adjustments during sessions to adapt to different students, and the situation at hand. For example, if there was a younger audience, we had to shorten our presentation portion of the lesson to keep them engaged. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
607 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Lastly, we also had to reach out to a variety of local organizations to establish connections and make Sparks of STEM sessions possible. This taught us the importance of networking and building relationships within the community. Hence, we are looking to recruit a designated outreach lead to increase our impact!)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
