/ActualText (Technology/Engineering Career Fair: With the aid of local organizations, such as STEM Like a Girl and the Portland Metro STEM Hub, we can organize a career fair inviting industry professionals and robotics teams. This will allow students to gain insights into various career paths and understand the real-world applications of STEM. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [19]
>>
